 to enter the venue as spectators.**\r\nBeing mindful of space, we can only accept requests of  **1 companion at MAX per competitor.**\r\nIf the number of requests would become too many,  a certain prioritization might be applied. (Ex. Guardians for minors)","externalWebsite":"https:\/\/speedcubing.or.jp\/competition\/AyaseSummer2023\/"},{"id":"LaPerreraOpen2023","name":"EuskalCubing La Perrera Open 2023","city":"Bilbao, Bizkaia","country":"ES","date":{"from":"2023-07-17","till":"2023-07-17","numberOfDays":1},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","pyram"],"wcaDelegates":[{"name":"Alejandro Nicolay","email":"anicolay@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Rub\u00e9n L\u00f3pez de Juan","email":"rjuan@worldcubeassociation.org"}],"organisers":[{"name":"Agus Wals","email":"agustinwals@gmail.com"},{"name":"Alejandro Nicolay","email":"anicolay@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Asociaci\u00f3n Espa\u00f1ola de Speedcubing","email":"junta@speedcubingspain.org"},{"name":"Astrid G\u00f3mez Martin","email":"astridgm1995@gmail.com"},{"name":"Eder Olivencia Gonz\u00e1lez","email":"origamieder@gmail.com"},{"name":"EuskalCubing","email":"contacto@euskalcubing.org"},{"name":"Rub\u00e9n L\u00f3pez de Juan","email":"rjuan@worldcubeassociation.org"}],"venue":{"name":"[La Perrera](https:\/\/bilbaogazte.bilbao.eus\/es\/konekta\/)","address":"Sabino Arana Etorbidea, 50","details":"Sala Polivalente","coordinates":{"latitude":43.256512,"longitude":-2.949129}},"information":"\r\nEste campeonato servir\u00e1 de presentaci\u00f3n de la renovada asociaci\u00f3n Vasco-Navarra de Speedcubing, Euskalcubing. Para mas informaci\u00f3n, ver la pesta\u00f1a [Euskalcubing](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/competitions\/EuskalCubingLaPerreraOpen2023#30509-euskalcubing).\r\n\r\nTxapelketa honek euskal speedcubing elkarte berrirako aurkezpen gisa erabiliko da. Informazio gehiago [EuskalCubing](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/competitions\/EuskalCubingLaPerreraOpen2023#30509-euskalcubing) erlaitzean.\r\n\r\nThis competition will serve as a presentation of the newly founded Basque Speedcubing Association. For more information, please look at this tab: [Euskalcubing](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/competitions\/EuskalCubingLaPerreraOpen2023#30509-euskalcubing).\r\n\r\nLos miembros de la **AES** recibir\u00e1n un reembolso del 15% al concluir el campeonato.\r\nMembers of the **AES** will receive a 15% refund at the end of the competition. \r\n**AES**-ko bazkideek %15ko diru-itzulketa jasoko dute txapelketa amaitzean. ","externalWebsite":null}]}